{"version":1,"content":"<p>新華社公布，中共中央政治局常委、全國政協主席王滬寧今（24日）陪同朝鮮勞動黨總書記、國務委員會委員長金正恩訪問丹東。</p><p>報道提到，金正恩離開丹東時，王滬寧到中朝新鴨綠江大橋送行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:50.448509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:08:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:40:32.577318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.016031+00:00","content_hash":"93e22f398809c642bc416a8b880e923a35778d869b10c81d4b50a570b2414bd8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}